{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821410/extras/796b482a26ad0789110eea532d54c37a.avif?t=1751367120\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821410/extras/e1747d5e287e2df9a7a2032eceaa4058.poster.avif?t=1751367120\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821410/extras/e1747d5e287e2df9a7a2032eceaa4058.mp4?t=1751367120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>\u25c6Welcome customers into your beautifully designed Parisian-inspired bakery with elegant d\u00e9cor and ambient charm, this new map brings a fresh atmosphere to your cooking adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821410/extras/97956ba9da0c70812e3b0eb32d7bfa12.avif?t=1751367120\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821410/extras/8000b4921308a245ddd80ddc379dbe1a.poster.avif?t=1751367120\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821410/extras/8000b4921308a245ddd80ddc379dbe1a.mp4?t=1751367120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>\u25c6Roll out dough and bake a wide array of delicious pastries from donuts to croissants. Add custom frosting colors, fillings, and toppings like sprinkles, glazes, and edible decorations to your sweets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821410/extras/b9e1cc08423544a937301bae278a5132.avif?t=1751367120\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821410/extras/2111c68d7cdd42d41d2437fd29055ac2.poster.avif?t=1751367120\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821410/extras/2111c68d7cdd42d41d2437fd29055ac2.mp4?t=1751367120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>\u25c6Now serving espresso! Use your brand-new coffee station to whip up rich espressos, creamy lattes, and more for your customers craving a caffeine fix.<br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821410/extras/ea3787a0f72936648cd13640d29fdd60.avif?t=1751367120\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821410/extras/0a0355381c105bcc98fb962676cb5d8f.poster.avif?t=1751367120\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821410/extras/0a0355381c105bcc98fb962676cb5d8f.mp4?t=1751367120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>\u25c6Bakery Mode brings new ways to serve your creations. Start your day with Daily Orders. Special requests arrive at your door. Bake what they ask and send it through the mailbox. Customers now sit at tables. Serve them directly and collect payment at the register once they finish. In a rush? Use the To Go Shelf. Place items there and customers will help themselves. They pay at the counter and leave happy.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3821410?t=1751367120","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3821410?t=1751367120","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821410/86b6b70543520b231466760f8ce58211ca719126/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751367120","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821410/86b6b70543520b231466760f8ce58211ca719126/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751367120","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821410/extras/796b482a26ad0789110eea532d54c37a.avif?t=1751367120\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821410/extras/e1747d5e287e2df9a7a2032eceaa4058.poster.avif?t=1751367120\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821410/extras/e1747d5e287e2df9a7a2032eceaa4058.mp4?t=1751367120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>\u25c6Welcome customers into your beautifully designed Parisian-inspired bakery with elegant d\u00e9cor and ambient charm, this new map brings a fresh atmosphere to your cooking adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821410/extras/97956ba9da0c70812e3b0eb32d7bfa12.avif?t=1751367120\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821410/extras/8000b4921308a245ddd80ddc379dbe1a.poster.avif?t=1751367120\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821410/extras/8000b4921308a245ddd80ddc379dbe1a.mp4?t=1751367120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>\u25c6Roll out dough and bake a wide array of delicious pastries from donuts to croissants. Add custom frosting colors, fillings, and toppings like sprinkles, glazes, and edible decorations to your sweets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821410/extras/b9e1cc08423544a937301bae278a5132.avif?t=1751367120\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821410/extras/2111c68d7cdd42d41d2437fd29055ac2.poster.avif?t=1751367120\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821410/extras/2111c68d7cdd42d41d2437fd29055ac2.mp4?t=1751367120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>\u25c6Now serving espresso! Use your brand-new coffee station to whip up rich espressos, creamy lattes, and more for your customers craving a caffeine fix.<br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821410/extras/ea3787a0f72936648cd13640d29fdd60.avif?t=1751367120\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821410/extras/0a0355381c105bcc98fb962676cb5d8f.poster.avif?t=1751367120\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821410/extras/0a0355381c105bcc98fb962676cb5d8f.mp4?t=1751367120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>\u25c6Bakery Mode brings new ways to serve your creations. Start your day with Daily Orders. Special requests arrive at your door. Bake what they ask and send it through the mailbox. Customers now sit at tables. Serve them directly and collect payment at the register once they finish. In a rush? Use the To Go Shelf. Place items there and customers will help themselves. They pay at the counter and leave happy.</p>","developers":["Biotech Gameworks"],"fullgame":{"appid":"1001270","name":"Kebab Chefs! - Restaurant Simulator"},"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821410/8b526dbe600511938a4a8854d6bdb77e7c1aea67/header.jpg?t=1751367120","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Kebab Chefs - Bakery DLC","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":[],"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"ratings":{"dejus":{"rating":"l"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821410/8fe32b84e6306e3bfd76da15203b1294bf3e4feb/ss_8fe32b84e6306e3bfd76da15203b1294bf3e4feb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1751367120","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821410/8fe32b84e6306e3bfd76da15203b1294bf3e4feb/ss_8fe32b84e6306e3bfd76da15203b1294bf3e4feb.600x338.jpg?t=1751367120"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.